  "body": "The unprefixed API is `Element.matches()` and after shipping this in Blink, usage of the unprefixed API remains ridiculously high, the highest of any prefixed API I think:\nhttps://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/217\n\nHad the unprefixed API been `Element.matchesSelector()` it might have been slightly better, but it's far too late for that, as `Element.matches()` has shipped in Blink, Gecko and WebKit.\n\nEdge, on the other hand, has both `Element.mstMatchesSelector()` and `Element.webkitMatchesSelector()`, so they have already concluded that all hope is lost.\n",
